<!-- TL;DR -->
<div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Professional suspended ceiling installation for offices, retail, and commercial spaces across Maidstone. Mineral fibre, metal, and acoustic tile options. Integrated lighting and 12-month guarantee.</p>
</div>

<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Suspended Ceiling Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Suspended ceilings are one of the most effective ways to modernise a commercial interior. At <strong>Drylining Maidstone</strong>, we install high-quality suspended ceiling systems that conceal ductwork, wiring, and plumbing while improving acoustics and lighting distribution.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Mineral fibre ceiling tiles (standard and acoustic)</li>
  <li>Metal ceiling tiles (perforated and plain)</li>
  <li>Plasterboard suspended ceilings</li>
  <li>Fire-rated ceiling systems</li>
  <li>Moisture-resistant tiles for kitchens and bathrooms</li>
  <li>Integrated lighting and air vent cutouts</li>
  <li>Emergency lighting integration</li>
  <li>Easy-access ceiling tiles for maintenance</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Install a Suspended Ceiling?</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Hide unsightly services:</strong> Suspended ceilings create a clean visual plane that conceals electrical cables, ductwork, pipes, and structural elements.</li>
  <li><strong>Improve acoustics:</strong> Acoustic ceiling tiles absorb sound and significantly reduce noise levels in open-plan offices, meeting rooms, and call centres.</li>
  <li><strong>Enhance lighting:</strong> Integrated LED panels and downlights create even light distribution and eliminate dark spots.</li>
  <li><strong>Easy maintenance access:</strong> Individual ceiling tiles can be removed to access building services for maintenance and repairs.</li>
  <li><strong>Fire safety:</strong> Fire-rated ceiling tiles and grid systems slow the spread of fire through ceiling voids and meet building regulation requirements.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use high-quality ceiling systems and tiles from trusted manufacturers to ensure durability, compliance, and a professional finish.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Armstrong, Rockfon, and British Gypsum suspended ceiling grid systems</li>
  <li>Mineral fibre tiles (standard, acoustic, and moisture-resistant)</li>
  <li>Metal ceiling tiles (perforated, plain, and powder-coated)</li>
  <li>Fire-rated tiles and grid components for Part B compliance</li>
  <li>LED panel and downlight integration</li>
  <li>Air conditioning vent cutouts and diffusers</li>
  <li>Emergency lighting and smoke detector integration</li>
  <li>Perimeter trim and edge finishing</li>
</ul>

<!-- Applications -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Applications & Use Cases</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our suspended ceiling services are suitable for a wide range of commercial and public buildings across Maidstone.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Open-plan offices and co-working spaces</li>
  <li>Retail stores and shopping centres</li>
  <li>Healthcare facilities and care homes</li>
  <li>Schools, colleges, and universities</li>
  <li>Warehouse and industrial unit offices</li>
  <li>Call centres and customer service hubs</li>
  <li>Leisure centres and community buildings</li>
</ul>

<!-- How It Works -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">How It Works</h2>
<ol style="list-style:decimal;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Free Quote:</strong> Call or fill in our form. We will survey your space and recommend the best ceiling system for your needs.</li>
  <li><strong>Detailed Plan:</strong> We confirm tile type, grid layout, lighting integration, and timeline. Everything is agreed upfront with no hidden extras.</li>
  <li><strong>Professional Installation:</strong> Our team installs the grid framework, fits the ceiling tiles, and integrates lighting and ventilation as required.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Check & Handover:</strong> We inspect every tile, test lighting and services, and leave your space looking professional and modern.</li>
</ol>

